      "updated": 1763836681078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RLHF upside",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RLHF upside",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kgzjt4Ciz890BdITtuB9A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 234.83283875719098,
      "y": 2279.3976121403666,
      "width": 1168.0468749999989,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PjeG2SBScagziyhYcjXmv"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 475980854,
      "version": 1426,
      "versionNonce": 1201631758,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763836760566,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We can run RL, in arbitrary domains! (even the unverifiable ones)\nThis (empirically) improves the performance of the model, possibly\ndue to the \"discriminator - generator gap\":\n\nIn many cases, it is much easier to discriminate than to generate.\n\ne.g. \"Write a poem\" vs. \"Which of these 5 poems is best?\"",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We can run RL, in arbitrary domains! (even the unverifiable ones)\nThis (empirically) improves the performance of the model, possibly due to the \"discriminator - generator gap\":\n\nIn many cases, it is much easier to discriminate than to generate.\n\ne.g. \"Write a poem\" vs. \"Which of these 5 poems is best?\"",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fPImA7Mi0dr1NmTN9Tri2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 234.36996970784458,
      "y": 2775.232392846814,
      "width": 872.2200427861351,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PjeG2SBScagziyhYcjXmv"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1117842806,
      "version": 3102,
      "versionNonce": 585976402,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763836681078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RLHF downside",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RLHF downside",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fd41A_CFXuht0zvMoMvph",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 228.9305528393361,
      "y": 2847.9509882000784,
      "width": 1168.0468749999989,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PjeG2SBScagziyhYcjXmv"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2119159478,
      "version": 2212,
      "versionNonce": 1704034797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763837043621,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We are doing RL with respect to a lossy simulation of humans. It\nmight be misleading!\n\nEven more subtle:\nRL discovers ways to \"game\" the model.\nIt discovers \"adversarial examples\" of the reward model.\n\nE.g. after 1,000 updates, the top joke can be something totally\nnon-sensical like \"the the the the the the the the\".",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We are doing RL with respect to a lossy simulation of humans. It might be misleading!\n\nEven more subtle:\nRL discovers ways to \"game\" the model.\nIt discovers \"adversarial examples\" of the reward model.\n\nE.g. after 1,000 updates, the top joke can be something totally non-sensical like \"the the the the the the the the\".",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Rsz9-q8zZuhfKgoSAHaCD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3278.889127935977,
      "y": 2877.0252377524725,
      "width": 1263.6921437571875,
      "height": 450.61562009732944,
      "angle": 4.702199046116631,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
