    },
    {
      "id": "z1kzPqkkI-lEff0gxBq-l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2123.4423112048216,
      "y": 2227.462334467517,
      "width": 904.2855631510411,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "ezVh-g-eyHO1fgNRDC4f1"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1314466934,
      "version": 1298,
      "versionNonce": 1899991570,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763835569306,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Remember that LLM think with a sequence of tokens and at each autoregressive step there\nis a finite amount of computation for each token.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe left answer is \"worse\" then the right one because we asking the model to predict the\ncorrect answer in this single step. In the right answer instead the computation needed to\ngive the correct answer is more distributed across many tokens. In other words, LLMs are\nmore reliable when can attend to more context.\n\nHow can we know the optimal sequence of tokens to create more reliable models?\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Remember that LLM think with a sequence of tokens and at each autoregressive step there is a finite amount of computation for each token.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe left answer is \"worse\" then the right one because we asking the model to predict the correct answer in this single step. In the right answer instead the computation needed to give the correct answer is more distributed across many tokens. In other words, LLMs are more reliable when can attend to more context.\n\nHow can we know the optimal sequence of tokens to create more reliable models?\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yIlv69anCgB4g4ArNcFjP",
      "type": "image",
      "x": -2006.2930789683805,
      "y": 2869.97871104803,
      "width": 544.0322047894307,
      "height": 399.51385000074896,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
