      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Human: How do I cook pasta?\nAssistant: Hi! Boil salted water, add pasta, \nand cook until tender (usually 8-12 minutes)\nHuman: and how do I know when it's done?\nAssistant: A simple method is tasting a \npiece. If you think it is not ready, wait \nanother 2-3 minutes and check again.\nLet me know if I can help with anything else\n:)",
      "fontSize": 21.648522054343943,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Human: How do I cook pasta?\nAssistant: Hi! Boil salted water, add pasta, \nand cook until tender (usually 8-12 minutes)\nHuman: and how do I know when it's done?\nAssistant: A simple method is tasting a \npiece. If you think it is not ready, wait \nanother 2-3 minutes and check again.\nLet me know if I can help with anything else\n:)",
