      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763996805581,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why bothering with language modeling",
      "fontSize": 39.54285714285655,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why bothering with language modeling",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RUiJF8702YrO8PP4muSdj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1500.0946432581495,
      "y": -2818.1430190518845,
      "width": 816.7993774414062,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b88",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 225913407,
      "version": 1689,
      "versionNonce": 895749830,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763996805581,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We build language models to use language like humans do — yet these models don’t \nthink the way humans do.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nProbabilistic knowledge can be very practical for a variety of tasks, including \nspeech recognition, machine translation, natural language generation, optical \ncharacter recognition, handwriting recognition, grammar induction, and \ninformation retrieval.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We build language models to use language like humans do — yet these models don’t \nthink the way humans do.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nProbabilistic knowledge can be very practical for a variety of tasks, including \nspeech recognition, machine translation, natural language generation, optical \ncharacter recognition, handwriting recognition, grammar induction, and \ninformation retrieval.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
