    {
      "id": "aT2n5EpsK1qSOisHtaEV8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -296.9415468110765,
      "y": 912.8108276151952,
      "width": 339.41961669921875,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 70,
      "groupIds": [
        "OTmAp2zUJ046rgABOI0S_"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2108032944,
      "version": 639,
      "versionNonce": 1894225067,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763995477311,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mistral Template\n\n<s>[INST] You are a helpful assistant.\n[/INST]\nHi! How can I help you today?</s>\n[INST] Hello! [/INST]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "VyZvSXCkqR99tV3N2fPrQ",
      "originalText": "Mistral Template\n\n<s>[INST] You are a helpful assistant. [/INST]\nHi! How can I help you today?</s>\n[INST] Hello! [/INST]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "i1BmZOiwV-ObZKescFHkr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -800.5447197981302,
      "y": 632.6876421276947,
      "width": 914.319091796875,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "OTmAp2zUJ046rgABOI0S_"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1825150384,
      "version": 852,
      "versionNonce": 376521285,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763995481086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chat templates are essential for structuring interactions between language models and users.\nThis structure is often passed to open AI API:\n\n        messages = [\n            {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\"},\n            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"},\n            {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Hi! How can I help you today?\"},\n            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What's the weather?\"},\n        ]\nWhat happen under the hood? Special tokens are added depending on the model family. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIt is still a Wild West:\n\n    - Llama 2 wraps system messages in <<SYS>> tags\n    - Llama 3 uses <|system|> tags with </s> endings\n    - Mistral includes system message in the first instruction\n    - Qwen uses explicit system role with <|im_start|> tags\n    - ChatGPT uses SYSTEM: prefix",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chat templates are essential for structuring interactions between language models and users.\nThis structure is often passed to open AI API:\n\n        messages = [\n            {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\"},\n            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"},\n            {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Hi! How can I help you today?\"},\n            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What's the weather?\"},\n        ]\nWhat happen under the hood? Special tokens are added depending on the model family. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIt is still a Wild West:\n\n    - Llama 2 wraps system messages in <<SYS>> tags\n    - Llama 3 uses <|system|> tags with </s> endings\n    - Mistral includes system message in the first instruction\n    - Qwen uses explicit system role with <|im_start|> tags\n    - ChatGPT uses SYSTEM: prefix",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
