      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763996813129,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "First we should\nask the question\nwhether LLM have\nachieved\nANYTHING in this\ndomain. Answer,\nNO, they have\nachieved ZERO",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2AQ91rTSWXjZIzMJQSVwz",
      "originalText": "First we should ask the question whether LLM have achieved ANYTHING in this domain. Answer, NO, they have achieved ZERO",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
